    19	#               file the evaluator opened is hashed again after the run (receipt). The receipt
    20	#               also binds eval_FLAC's own sha256 + length of the buffer it handed torch.load.
    21	#   predicate   (cycle 4b) SKIP only a complete-and-verified cell; QUARANTINE the rest.
    22	#   run         one lane per GPU: >= 10 GiB free AND no compute process on the card (uuid-mapped,
    23	#               fail-closed queries, re-checked right before the spawn); never signals anything.
    24	#
    25	# Usage:  EXPECT_HEAD=<40-hex pin> bash depth_canon_eval_run.sh [--blocks B,..]
    26	#           [--only CELL,..] [--limit N] [--no-dump-blocks B,..] [--dump-root DIR]
    27	#           [--lanes 0,1] [--canon-ckpt-manifest PATH]
    28	#   DRY_RUN=1  every gate except the side-effecting / GPU ones: no link, no mkdir, no
    29	#              quarantine, no evaluation; prints each cell's exact argv.
    30	#   GPU_POLL_SECONDS (default 600), GPU_MAX_POLLS (default 0 = wait for ever).
    31	#   ALLOW_SHARED_GPU=1  Yixun's explicit opt-in (decision A6): a card holding foreign compute
    32	#              processes may be used; the memory floor and the query-integrity checks stay.
    33	#   DEPTH_CANON_EVAL_HARNESS=<dir under /tmp holding a .depth_canon_eval_harness marker>:
    34	#              test mode only -- DEPTH_CANON_EVAL_PY (stub evaluator) and DEPTH_CANON_CELLS
    35	#              are honoured, and the farm / logs / lock move into that dir.
    36	# Pin: EXPECT_HEAD == HEAD and a committed relevant tree at start; its content digest is
    37	#   re-computed before EVERY spawn and after every cell (bound into the receipt): a change
    38	#   stops the campaign (no further spawn; running cells finish; nothing is killed).
    39	# Exit: 0 all selected cells complete (or DRY_RUN) | 1 a cell failed | 2 a gate refused |
    40	#   4 PIN DRIFT: HEAD or the relevant tree changed during the campaign.
    41	#
    42	# exp_35 (plan_orbitrir_yaw_evidence.md r2 §3b / §11 B1, r3 §12 B1.1 / H4): a cell whose plan entry says
    43	#   no_flash (every exp_35 block) is spawned through the committed launcher overlays/no_flash/
    44	#   exp35_no_flash_launch.py with PYTHONPATH=<repo>/overlays/no_flash ONLY and PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1;
    45	#   the overlay + launcher sha256 are pinned below and checked at start, the launcher's CPU pre-flight runs
    46	#   before any spawn (DRY_RUN too), and after rc 0 the cell log must carry the backend evidence
    47	#   (depth_canon_collect.py --check-backend-log) or the campaign hard-stops (exit 2, no receipt); its
    48	#   receipt is schema 2. EXP35_APPROVED_COTENANTS=<file> (needs ALLOW_SHARED_GPU=1; required to share a
    49	#   card with an exp_35 cell): the lane's foreign compute processes must EQUAL that identity tuple
    50	#   (exp35_gpu_identity.py --check) at the lane selection and at the final pre-spawn check, else exit 2.
    51	#
    52	# Written by the exp_25 Coder seat (Claude Opus 5.5, max effort) per plan_depth_canon.md v9 §5.
    53	# ============================================================================
    54	set -uo pipefail
    55	
    56	REPO="$(git -C "$(dirname "$(readlink -f "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")")" rev-parse --show-toplevel)"
