   586	    the driver's receipt (its committed-artifact digests and dump evidence), the dump
   587	    (``dump_check`` 'full' = ``is_complete`` once, 'manifest' = marker + manifest, both + the
   588	    receipt's evidence == the dump on disk; 'receipt' = OFFLINE, the receipt's evidence stands
   589	    for the dump, no NAS read), and -- ``check_link`` -- the farm entry's cache identity.
